# ** 20. With an explicit lot selector, the same error also lists the
# matching lots - at most 10, with a count and total of the rest.
<
commodity ADA ; lots:

2026-01-01 reward 1
    assets:wallet    2 ADA @ $0.41
    revenues:staking

2026-01-01 reward 2
    assets:wallet    2 ADA @ $0.42
    revenues:staking

2026-01-01 reward 3
    assets:wallet    2 ADA @ $0.43
    revenues:staking

2026-01-01 reward 4
    assets:wallet    2 ADA @ $0.44
    revenues:staking

2026-01-01 reward 5
    assets:wallet    2 ADA @ $0.45
    revenues:staking

2026-01-01 reward 6
    assets:wallet    2 ADA @ $0.46
    revenues:staking

